    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set on a generous site extending to approximately 0.56 hectares (1.38 acres), this traditional detached cottage at Glenbeg, Glencairn presents an excellent opportunity to restore and transform a character-filled property in an attractive rural setting.\r\n\r\nThe residence is in need of complete renovation and refurbishment throughout and offers  purchasers the opportunity to create a home tailored to their own requirements. The existing accommodation includes a kitchen, living/reception areas, bedrooms and bathroom facilities, with significant potential for redevelopment and expansion.  \r\n\r\nA particular feature of the property is the c. 1.38-acre site, which extends predominantly to the rear of the dwelling. The grounds are presently overgrown but benefit from mature trees, hedgerows and established boundaries, offering considerable potential to create gardens, \r\nrecreational areas or other amenity space.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking a genuine renovation project, Glenbeg represents an opportunity to breathe new life into a traditional country cottage and create an attractive rural residence."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen, Living/Reception Areas, 2 Bedrooms, Bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Conveniently located to a number of surrounding towns and villages, Ballyduff Upper, \r\n\tLismore, Tallow and just 20 minutes from Dungarvan and Fermoy.\r\nLarge level site extending to c. 0.56 Ha. (1.38 acres).\r\nSignificant potential for redevelopment, reconfiguration and extension, subject to necessary planning permission.\r\nMay qualify for grants such as the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and National Home Energy Upgrade Scheme, subject to purchaser eligibility and the applicable terms and conditions.\r\nPicturesque views over surrounding countryside."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      }
